This project implements Semantic Similarity Rating (SSR) as described by
Maier et al., "LLMs Reproduce Human Purchase Intent via Semantic Similarity
Elicitation of Likert Ratings", arXiv:2510.08338,
https://arxiv.org/abs/2510.08338

The probability mapping follows that paper and the published Apache-2.0
reference implementation at
https://github.com/pymc-labs/semantic-similarity-rating
This repository does not vendor that code.
